      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can now manage GitHub Copilot code review settings through the REST and GraphQL APIs, from enterprise policy down to individual repositories.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot&rsquo;s review overview comment is now more compact, and this update includes fixes for billing, automatic reviews, and reliability.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "These updates are available to Copilot Pro, Pro+, Max, Business, and Enterprise plans.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "See the review effort a review used, when that metadata is available.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Organization administrators can manage code review enablement, the default review effort, and the runner configuration.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The REST API accepts the same review effort levels as the web interface, and organization and repository settings responses list the levels available to you.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To get started, see Configuring Copilot code review with the API .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot code review agent sessions now show the AI credits consumed in a review.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Automatically request Copilot code review repository rule now supports the bypass list, so exempt actors in the list will not receive an automatic review from Copilot.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot code review organization and repository settings pages have clearer wording and layout.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-06-copilot-code-review-api-management-and-review-overview-updates",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-07T00:27:19.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:47.969Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
